    {
      "subId": "7508707",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Taruka",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750870701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750870701": {
            "id": "750870701",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Taruka! You're back already!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870702"
            ]
          },
          "750870702": {
            "id": "750870702",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "#{M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME}! I'm so glad you're okay... I've told my sister and everyone about what happened. Lamizana's just as big of an idiot as I thought...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870703"
            ]
          },
          "750870703": {
            "id": "750870703",
            "speakerId": 6178,
            "speakerName": "Oberon",
            "text": "Crooo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870704"
            ]
          },
          "750870704": {
            "id": "750870704",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "Yes, even dumber than you, birdbrain!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870705"
            ]
          },
          "750870705": {
            "id": "750870705",
            "speakerId": 6178,
            "speakerName": "Oberon",
            "text": "Crooo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870706"
            ]
          },
          "750870706": {
            "id": "750870706",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Okay, okay, guess he's really upset after being separated from you for so long. Also, he worked super well with {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} just now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870707"
            ]
          },
          "750870707": {
            "id": "750870707",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's still room for more improvement.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870708"
            ]
          },
          "750870708": {
            "id": "750870708",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, we're still talking about a little Saurian, here! As long as you treat him right, Taruka, Paimon's sure he'll grow into an outstanding Qucusaurus!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870709"
            ]
          },
          "750870709": {
            "id": "750870709",
            "speakerId": 6178,
            "speakerName": "Oberon",
            "text": "Kraaaa!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870710"
            ]
          },
          "750870710": {
            "id": "750870710",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, how did you get back here? Did someone find you and save you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870711"
            ]
          },
          "750870711": {
            "id": "750870711",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "I escaped by myself. I wanted to bring Oberon with me, but he was busy eating Saurus Crackers and wouldn't move no matter what I did. I got angry, so I left by myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870712"
            ]
          },
          "750870712": {
            "id": "750870712",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? It was that easy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870713"
            ]
          },
          "750870713": {
            "id": "750870713",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "After figuring out the movement patterns of the Saurian guards, I realized there was an opening I could use to escape. Got out of there smoothly afterward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870714"
            ]
          },
          "750870714": {
            "id": "750870714",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y'know, you might just be the most reliable one here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870715"
            ]
          },
          "750870715": {
            "id": "750870715",
            "speakerId": 6171,
            "speakerName": "Lamizana",
            "text": "What took you so long? I was just about to settle matters with that liar... a—and officially apologize to you guys, of course... I was way too arbitrary, and almost framed innocent people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870717",
              "750870719"
            ]
          },
          "750870717": {
            "id": "750870717",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right! You only appeared after everything ended. If that isn't trying to steal credit, then what is?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870720"
            ]
          },
          "750870720": {
            "id": "750870720",
            "speakerId": 6171,
            "speakerName": "Lamizana",
            "text": "I haven't any leg to stand on, so I'll pay you the agreed compensation or whatever you want from me. I won't be stingy about it. You can even punch me if it'll make you feel better!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750870721"
            ]
          },
          "750870721": {
            "id": "750870721",
            "speakerId": 6171,
            "speakerName": "Lamizana",
            "text": "I'm a real man, so I won't try to weasel out of my responsibilities."
          },
          "750870719": {
            "id": "750870719",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So you haven't forgotten about the participation prize..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7508712",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750871221"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750871221": {
            "id": "750871221",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "<UNKNOWN>",
            "text": "You return to your previous location before you can be discovered. Try to be a bit more careful next time..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7508759",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750875901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750875901": {
            "id": "750875901",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "We still have a few more flying challenges. Details are written on the board. Give 'em a try if you're keen... Of course, there are prizes to be won.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875903",
              "750875906",
              "750875910"
            ]
          },
          "750875903": {
            "id": "750875903",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "Honestly, I have no clue why it's called that. But speaking of Pakpaka... Have you ever heard the story of Kuntur and the evil sorcerer Rumi?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875904"
            ]
          },
          "750875904": {
            "id": "750875904",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "The warriors of the tribe were defeated by that wicked mage, and he turned them into Pakpaka... which doesn't sound all that good. Maybe Pakpakas fly very quickly, or something — I don't know."
          },
          "750875906": {
            "id": "750875906",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "Haha... He's a good fighter, but not necessarily a good teacher. And as an opponent in flying competitions... I guess he's passable?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875907"
            ]
          },
          "750875907": {
            "id": "750875907",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "But I mean, why would you come here if you didn't have issues with flying? So, if I were to be too strict... *sigh* Well, it's not like things like this have never happened in the past.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875908"
            ]
          },
          "750875908": {
            "id": "750875908",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "That's why I focus on encouraging people nowadays. I'm sure that approach will get results just fine too."
          },
          "750875910": {
            "id": "750875910",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "See you. You're welcome back any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7508763",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750876301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750876301": {
            "id": "750876301",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "Welcome to Pakpaka Flying School!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750876304",
              "750876307"
            ]
          },
          "750876304": {
            "id": "750876304",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "We give all cadets the necessary guidance and help they need. Things have changed a lot, you know. Back in the day, students couldn't expect that kind of tender loving care.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750876305"
            ]
          },
          "750876305": {
            "id": "750876305",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "But then there was this one time when the coach was a little... strict with their words, and the student in question just happened to have quite a temper... *sigh* Yeah, that's not a fun one to talk about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750876306"
            ]
          },
          "750876306": {
            "id": "750876306",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "Anyway, our teaching policy's been shaken up since then. And I mean, nobody slaps a smiling face, and nobody hates compliments, am I right?"
          },
          "750876307": {
            "id": "750876307",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "Here's to a pleasant day!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}